  itemName: Baseball Cap
  modelPrefab: {fileID: 4922395623162246200, guid: 22d399717c5ee0549b7a55d3408f4d1b, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - I used to wear a hat like this all the time. I was the "hat kid" in school, always
    wearing the same hat.
  - 'Ever since I lost a really old hat of mine I stopped wearing hats. '
  - This hat though, it reminds me so much of my old I might go back to it. Maybe
    not right now though, that would be kind of a gross hat to wear after just pulling
    it out of the water.
